[statement]
Reduced from Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`, 2026-11-08), asked for
`pimcommon`. Through `iso-codes-lang`'s condition (`lang`) and
`akonadi-contacts-lang`'s, the walk reaches `ktextaddons`, and from it
`dbus:org.freedesktop.Secrets`, before `so:libKF6Wallet.so.6`; but a name
reached early through conditions is not decided early
(`install-if/the-names-a-condition-states-number-nothing`), and apk
installs `kwallet` alone. Contrast
`install-if/conditions-that-never-hold-steer-a-choice`, where the
conditions lead to `so:libKF6Wallet.so.6` first.

